   "entry_id": "aligher",
   "tier": "common",
   "dc": null,
   "dc_is_placeholder": false,
   "teaser": null,
   "body": "Aligher is one of the seven officers of {{company|the Company}}, and {{valthar|Valthar}}'s 'procurement specialist'. He can get his hands on almost anything.",
   "adds_aliases": [],
   "editorial_status": "canon",
   "canon_ref": "R-102; R-116"
  },
  {
   "skill": "history",
   "culture_id": null,
   "skill_tag_reason": null,
   "pull_quote": null,
   "id": "f-al-2",
   "entry_id": "aligher",
   "tier": "baseline",
   "dc": 12,
   "dc_is_placeholder": true,
   "teaser": null,
   "body": "Before the Company he was a thief, then a no-questions-asked quartermaster at a small backwater fort. Whose fort it was: [TBD]. He was one of the newest additions to Valthar's old party.",
   "adds_aliases": [],
   "editorial_status": "canon",
   "canon_ref": "R-102; R-112"
  },
  {
   "skill": "history",
   "culture_id": null,
   "skill_tag_reason": null,
   "pull_quote": "He takes what's needed. Sometimes a little more, if it helps the Company.",
   "id": "f-al-3",
   "entry_id": "aligher",
   "tier": "baseline",
   "dc": 10,
   "dc_is_placeholder": true,
   "teaser": null,
   "body": "These days he mostly takes only what's needed. If he sees something that could help him, his friends or the Company, he won't hesitate to snag it.",
   "adds_aliases": [],
   "editorial_status": "canon",
   "canon_ref": "R-102"
  },
  {
   "skill": "history",
   "culture_id": null,
   "skill_tag_reason": null,
   "pull_quote": null,
   "id": "f-al-4",
   "entry_id": "aligher",
   "tier": "roll",
   "dc": 16,
   "dc_is_placeholder": true,
   "teaser": "How Valthar found him.",
   "body": "He had worked with the Emperor once before, on another job, not long service. Valthar tracked him down as someone who could give him information, and Aligher impressed him enough to get hired.",
   "adds_aliases": [],
   "editorial_status": "canon",
   "canon_ref": "R-102 (canon backstory; not confirmed player-known, so roll-gated)"
  },
