   "tier": "discovery",
   "dc": null,
   "dc_is_placeholder": false,
   "teaser": null,
   "body": "She was a pirate ship called the Widow's Mercy. We stole her from a pirate harbour, refitted her so nobody could tell what she had been, renamed her The Empress and gave her to Salt.",
