   "dc": null,
   "dc_is_placeholder": false,
   "teaser": null,
   "body": "The Emperor was a despot. His forces were the Ivory Guard. About 16.5 years ago, {{valthar|Valthar}} and his party deposed and killed him and took his tower. They became {{company|the Company}}.",
